KoeInput for Debian
===================

No speech recognition model is in the package. Install one once per user:

  koeinput model install parakeet-ja

`koeinput model list` shows the available models and the license of each;
models are downloaded from their publishers and are not covered by
/usr/share/doc/koeinput/copyright.

Recognition runs locally on the CPU; audio does not leave the computer.

The daemon is not enabled or started at boot. D-Bus starts it on demand: when
fcitx5 loads the addon, or when the koeinput command first needs it.

After installing fcitx5-koeinput, restart fcitx5 so that it loads the addon.

Logs:

  journalctl --user -u koeinput
